    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to a cute town centre property that`s tucked away beside Fair Green park and overlooks the Dundalk Bay Estuary and Carlingford Mountains. \n\nMichael Lavelle Estate Agents offers this 3 bedroom house for sale in Dundalk. It is close to town, has spacious accommodation and will appeal to local buyers, buyers from Dublin as well as investors. \n\nThis end terrace property comes to market ready for its next owner to make it their own. Whilst it will benefit from some energy efficiency improvement, the house is in solid shape and its advantages are numerous:\n•Great location within walking distance of high street (2 minutes) and just a 15 minute walk to hop on the bus to Dublin / Belfast \n•3 good sized bedrooms (3rd is at ground floor) \n•Front overlooks playing grounds and lovely mountain and river setting \n•Larger bedroom has shower, suggesting ease of provision for ensuite \n•2 low maintenance outdoor yard areas (1 with power and plumbing and the other as storage for bins & bikes)\n\nAdditional information \n•Gas heating \n•Onstreet parking \n"
      },
